WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:15.947
The audience watched as Mr. Chen pretended to take off the chicken's head.

2
00:00:15.948 --> 00:00:19.570
Then he held up a chicken head for everyone to see.

3
00:00:19.571 --> 00:00:23.807
I knew, of course, that it wasn't a real chicken head.

4
00:00:23.808 --> 00:00:27.511
But the little girl in pigtails started to cry.

5
00:00:27.512 --> 00:00:31.814
"It's just a magic trick, Brandy," her mom told her.

6
00:00:31.815 --> 00:00:35.723
"The magician didn't really take off the chicken's head."

7
00:00:35.724 --> 00:00:40.995
While we watched, Mr. Chen stuck the chicken's head back on again.

8
00:00:40.996 --> 00:00:44.174
"Cluck! Cluck!" scolded the chicken.

9
00:00:44.175 --> 00:00:47.778
I didn't think it liked being in a magic show.

10
00:00:47.779 --> 00:00:50.912
Everyone cheered and clapped.

11
00:00:50.913 --> 00:00:56.113
Mr. Scary took his chicken back, and Mr. Chen continued the show.

12
00:00:56.114 --> 00:01:00.335
Next he did a trick with two one-dollar bills.

13
00:01:00.336 --> 00:01:05.914
He cut them both in half, and then he put them back together again.

14
00:01:05.915 --> 00:01:09.855
"Mr. Chen is a really good magician!" I thought.

15
00:01:09.856 --> 00:01:16.590
For his next trick, Mr. Chen made a shiny gold coin vanish into thin air.

16
00:01:16.591 --> 00:01:18.687
The audience loved it.

17
00:01:18.688 --> 00:01:22.845
Even Mr. Scary was starting to look impressed.

18
00:01:22.846 --> 00:01:28.387
"And now," said Mr. Chen, "for my best and final trick."

19
00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:35.257
He signaled to Josh, who then led Bunch up to the front of the lounge.

20
00:01:35.258 --> 00:01:38.705
"I will make this dog disappear!"

21
00:01:38.706 --> 00:01:42.412
"I can't wait to see this," I thought.

22
00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:46.997
Mr. Chen opened a wooden box and placed it on the floor.

23
00:01:46.998 --> 00:01:52.817
Josh helped his dad put Bunch in the box.

24
00:01:52.818 --> 00:01:57.505
Then Mr. Chen slid the box under the tablecloth.

25
00:01:57.506 --> 00:02:00.206
I saw Caswell crawl in after Bunch.

26
00:02:00.207 --> 00:02:02.415
Molly had spotted him too.

27
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:05.140
"Caswell!" she whispered.

28
00:02:05.141 --> 00:02:08.006
"What are you doing under there?"

29
00:02:08.007 --> 00:02:12.060
"I want to see Bunch disappear," said Caswell.

30
00:02:12.061 --> 00:02:15.822
"Come out right now," Molly ordered him.

31
00:02:15.823 --> 00:02:20.367
But Caswell crawled further under the table.

32
00:02:20.368 --> 00:02:22.905
Molly looked at me helplessly.

33
00:02:22.906 --> 00:02:27.986
There wasn't anything she could do without interrupting Mr. Chen's show.

34
00:02:27.987 --> 00:02:32.414
"The dog is in the box," Mr. Chen was saying.

35
00:02:32.415 --> 00:02:35.813
"But he will disappear when I say the magic words.

36
00:02:35.814 --> 00:02:40.924
Abracadabra, pow! Make this dog disappear now!"

37
00:02:40.925 --> 00:02:44.030
Mr. Chen waved his hand.

38
00:02:44.031 --> 00:02:49.154
Then he lifted the tablecloth and opened the box again.

39
00:02:49.155 --> 00:02:54.014
The little girl, Brandy, stood up on her chair to see better.

40
00:02:54.015 --> 00:02:56.820
Sure enough, the box was empty.

41
00:02:56.821 --> 00:02:59.872
Bunch had vanished!

42
00:02:59.873 --> 00:03:04.762
"Bring the doggie back!" cried Brandy.

43
00:03:04.763 --> 00:03:09.808
"This is the fun part," said Mr. Chen with a big smile.

44
00:03:09.809 --> 00:03:12.567
"Let's all say the magic words together:

45
00:03:12.568 --> 00:03:15.195
'Abracadabra, click and clack.

46
00:03:15.196 --> 00:03:18.220
Bring that little dog right back!'"

47
00:03:18.221 --> 00:03:22.411
Mr. Chen waved his hand over the table again.

48
00:03:22.412 --> 00:03:26.196
Then he said the magic words, and everyone joined in.

49
00:03:26.197 --> 00:03:29.006
"Abracadabra, click and clack.

50
00:03:29.007 --> 00:03:32.739
Bring that little dog right back!"

51
00:03:32.740 --> 00:03:34.601
Mr. Chen opened the box.

52
00:03:34.978 --> 00:03:39.018
Everyone stood up to see.

53
00:03:39.019 --> 00:03:44.779
But there was no sign of Bunch!

54
00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:48.164
"Where's the doggie?" cried Brandy.

55
00:03:48.165 --> 00:03:53.348
"Yes, where is the dog?" a few people echoed.

56
00:03:53.349 --> 00:03:56.306
Josh and Jenny looked mystified.

57
00:03:56.307 --> 00:04:00.268
Even Mr. Chen looked a little confused.

58
00:04:00.269 --> 00:04:04.953
I had a feeling this was not what he expected.

59
00:04:04.954 --> 00:04:10.685
Mr. Chen finally leaned over and whispered something to Josh, who nodded.

60
00:04:10.686 --> 00:04:14.353
"Ladies and gentlemen!" Mr. Chen called.

61
00:04:14.354 --> 00:04:17.457
"In a moment you will see the dog reappear.

62
00:04:17.458 --> 00:04:21.560
Until then I will perform another special magic trick."

63
00:04:21.561 --> 00:04:22.000
Mr. Chen took out a ball of string and a pair of scissors.

64
00:04:26.084 --> 00:04:32.652
"I will cut this string," he said, "and chew the two pieces back together again!"

65
00:04:32.653 --> 00:04:38.166
That sounded like a good trick, I thought, but what about Bunch?

66
00:04:38.167 --> 00:04:43.525
How would Mr. Chen bring him back?

67
00:04:43.526 --> 00:04:49.000
While Mr. Chen was doing the string trick, Josh rushed over to me.

68
00:04:49.001 --> 00:04:51.876
"Bunch is gone!" he whispered.

69
00:04:51.877 --> 00:04:58.908
"We have to find him, or my dad's magic show will be ruined!"
